    <div style="text-align: justify; font-size: 14px;">
        <p>The SMU Geothermal Lab was established in <span data-field="lab_establishment_year">{{ lab_establishment_year }}</span> by <span data-field="lab_founder_name">{{ lab_founder_name }}</span>. We are a self-funded research facility, with a variety of ongoing geothermal resource projects. Our faculty, staff, and students strive to broaden the understanding and use of geothermal energy, from the simplest form, geothermal heat pumps for buildings, to the large-scale deployment of geothermal power plants providing energy for our cities. Our research also explores opportunities to integrate renewable geothermal projects in oil and gas setting.</p>
